  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ee068039f9324b9c4b25fd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>Show Time模式</color>中完成育成后，会按照育成进度\\n和挑战的难易度效果提升<color=#ff9900>SHOW量表</color>。\\n根据SHOW量表储存至MAX的次数，\\n可获得相应<color=#ff9900>额外奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a75a45b3aeb1bb782f5d0b95dc4b0912c3d5f79e14171bbec6d4e8323aa6099",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bbf1ceb7b1d72e99796a467",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在Show Time模式，育成的比赛里，\\n<color=#ff9900>比赛对手赛马娘</color>将会增强。\\n在某个难易度中观看了<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘好结局</color>之后，\\n将解锁更高一级的难易度\\n可在下次育成进行挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "380b43ed9fcc0db7018c9a0cacc3d6c96d2ed18d029b56b86d49141b98cc083f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76a2890632808c8f8314fac2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成<color=#ff9900>符合适性的赛马娘</color>，\\n通过达成指定的<color=#ff9900>分数奖励</color>条件\\n可获得更多分数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33e89146fc0cb17f6ed5137a82db7f527896ae9f1499183bef9e3db01bed6d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11dd99418acd6d2931644d09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在「<color=#ff9900>训练员技能考试</color>」中，\\n每个考试项目的<color=#ff9900>支援卡使用率</color>的\\n排名都能查看哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8f5fa082dabca8dc8273e218e562f047234edf2566563de15b5afb213b2d27",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94113828ff38de5e7b9db144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中育成赛马娘没有各自的目标，\\n<color=#ff9900>获得「成绩点数」将成为共同目标</color>！\\n在新马级、经典级、古马级比赛中收集\\n成绩点数吧！成绩点数可根据参加比赛的规格和所得名次\\n来获取，育成中可自由选择要参加的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e9e9733bef207151b0799daa2cdf7c3525453efb2c7c76fb2016d97772ad82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa4a0a397833f6826aebc35e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>达成所有育成目标</color>之后\\n可以挑战<color=#ff9900>闪耀明星巅峰赛</color>！\\n在这三场比赛中取胜\\n赢取「闪耀最强星」的宝座吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57517a6385910033a08b10e012887b146d6b146f618ec5450b04e2185fc9d3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5614dc62614db191ffa09ddc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中入着（前五名）后除成绩点数之外<color=#ff9900>还可获得「商店币」！</color>\\n商店币可在特殊商店中兑换育成商品。\\n使用育成商品后可以提高基础能力、回复体力\\n或者增加一定时间内训练可获得的属性\\n<color=#ff9900>还可获得对育成有帮助的各种效果！</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0a3e363b0ec0e716d68b82d4b0cf7b92b6081a4fa65b64938277b157b980c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83fdcf138905bb55ee9de051",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>每年12月后半的回合结束时</color>，各级会表彰\\n<color=#ff9900>表现最活跃的赛马娘</color>。与支持自己的人们\\n加深交流的同时，在比赛中取得好成绩，增加\\n粉丝数吧！受表彰后可获得固有技能等级提升等奖励，\\n育成赛马娘将因此成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd21063d2a6e13e46f20e63936cbe5ae82fbcfe1d80d8db1ac69634d106d4da0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "99"
      ]
    },
